--TEST--
the `function` keyword names no symbol, so renaming there is refused, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
func<|>tion helper(): int
{
    return 1;
}

echo helper();
--REQUEST--
rename to=one
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
